## Components

### Buttons (Primary)
Dark background, split layout with arrow:
```
group inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 text-white
├── Label: px-7 py-4 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase
└── Arrow: flex items-center border-l border-white/15 px-5 py-4
    └── svg chevron (h-4 w-4), shifts right on hover
```

### Buttons (Secondary)
Outline/ghost, same structure:
```
group inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-900
├── Label: px-7 py-4 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase
└── Arrow: flex items-center border-l border-neutral-200 px-5 py-4
```

On dark backgrounds: `border-white/20 text-white`

### Buttons (Text/Link)
Simple arrow link (AIRCO-style CTAs):
```
inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium transition-opacity hover:opacity-70
└── Arrow svg or → character
```

### Cards (Service Cards)
- Aspect ratio: `aspect-[4/5]` — tall portrait
- Rounded: `rounded-2xl`
- Image fills card with subtle gradient overlay from bottom
- Tag pill bottom-left: `rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm`
- Title below card (not overlaid)
- Hover: gentle scale `group-hover:scale-[1.03]`

### Eyebrow Labels
```
text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-400 uppercase
```
On dark: `text-white/40`

