## Section Patterns

### Hero (Homepage — AIRCO-style)
- Full viewport height, full-bleed image
- Dark overlay: `bg-black/40` to `bg-black/50`
- Navbar overlays (fixed, transparent)
- Large headline in bottom-left or center-right (asymmetric placement)
- Stats or secondary info positioned opposite to headline
- Content should feel anchored to the lower third of the viewport

### Statement Section (Large Text Block)
- Full-width white background
- Single large paragraph as `text-xl md:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed`
- Max width constrained: `max-w-4xl` or `max-w-3xl`
- Extreme vertical padding — this IS the section

### Split Section (Text + Image)
- 12-column grid with generous gap
- Asymmetric: content in 5 cols, image in 7 cols (or inverse)
- Image: `rounded-2xl` with `aspect-[4/3]` or `aspect-[3/4]`
- No borders on images — clean edges

### Feature Section (Dark, Immersive)
- `bg-neutral-950` or `bg-[#0a0a0a]`
- Full-width, generous padding: `py-32 md:py-44`
- Large heading + supporting text left, visual element or list right
- Numbers/indicators with accent colour borders

### Grid Section (Cards/Capabilities)
- 2, 3, or 4 columns
- `gap-6` to `gap-8`
- Cards with subtle background (`bg-neutral-50`) or no background (clean)
- Consistent internal padding

### Partners / Logo Strip
- Minimal treatment — text logos or small marks
- Horizontal scroll or static grid
- Muted colours — no full-colour logos

---

## Imagery

### Style (AIRCO-influenced)
- Cinematic, atmospheric, high-contrast
- Environmental shots — products in context, facilities, operations
- Dark moody tones for hero/feature sections
- Clean, bright for editorial/split sections
- Never clip-art or overly stylised

### Sizing
- Hero: full-bleed `min-h-screen` with `object-cover`
- Feature images: `aspect-[16/9]` or `aspect-[21/9]` for cinematic
- Split sections: `aspect-[4/3]` or `aspect-[3/4]`
- Cards: `aspect-[4/5]` portrait
- All images: `rounded-2xl object-cover`

---

## Animation & Motion

### Principles
- Restrained and purposeful — AIRCO uses almost no motion
- Hover states only: opacity shifts, gentle scale
- No scroll-triggered animations unless specifically requested
- Page should feel stable and grounded, not playful

### Specifics
- Image hover: `transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]`
- Link/button hover: `transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-70`
- Accordion/toggle: `transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out`
- Carousel: CSS-only, `animation: scroll linear infinite`, pauses on hover

### Avoid
- Parallax effects
- Entrance animations
- Loading spinners or skeleton screens
- Scroll hijacking
- Decorative motion of any kind

---

## Responsive Strategy

### Breakpoints
- Mobile-first
- `md:` (768px) — grids become multi-column
- `lg:` (1024px) — larger type, wider spacing

### Mobile Behaviour
- Hero headline scales down but remains large: `text-4xl` minimum
- Grids collapse to single column
- Images maintain aspect ratio, full width
- Navbar: hamburger toggle
- Extreme padding reduces but remains generous

---

## Accessibility

- Semantic HTML: `nav`, `main`, `section`, `footer`, `h1`–`h3`
- One `h1` per page
- `aria-label` on navigation, footer, key sections
- `aria-expanded` on interactive toggles
- Alt text on all images
- Minimum WCAG AA colour contrast
- Focus-visible styles on all interactive elements

